  "summary": "Adopted the published Files SDK as Plate’s official optional upload protocol through platejs/files and platejs/files/react; moved request lifetime into the editor, kept mediaUpload as the draft document state, split FilesKit from MediaKit, replaced UploadThing with a fail-closed copied R2/S3 gateway, and synchronized registry, docs, release artifacts and doctrine.",
