        "sha256": "1d6af0ace59350e6b392e5603ee486fa8bd24ce32616f722090a769e3fd99609",
        "claim": "Final source-bound production owner rerun: four frozen cohorts and all 16 lifetime guards pass with no source drift."
      },
      {
        "path": "docs/plans/artifacts/official-files-sdk-integration/testing-methodology-evidence.md",
        "sha256": "aa58ec944687d0378d8995d16f1fe830d0d741ba1a93d49d45f704ef594a4560",
        "claim": "Maps the upstream Files SDK testing methodology to the adopted package, gateway, browser and provider proof layers."
      }
    ],
    "limits": "Verified package, copied UI, installed SDK gateway, Chromium picker/XHR, clean Base/Nova and Radix/Luma installs, generated outputs and frozen owner scale behavior. No live R2/S3 account, authenticated application policy, native file drag, Firefox/WebKit or production deployment was exercised. The broad www source typecheck remains blocked by the pre-existing HistoryPlugin recursive type-instantiation limit; focused Files checks, the platejs source typecheck and clean installed consumers pass."
  },
